tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا‌ۚ و</span>َهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ بِغَيْرِ عَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">دٍ ت</span>َرَوْنَهَا‌ۖ وَأَلْقَىٰ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ رَو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>سِىَ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َمِيدَ بِكُمْ وَبَثَّ فِيهَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُلِّ د<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓبَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ‌ۚ و</span>َأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلْنَا مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ءً ف</span>َأَ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نۢب</span>َتْنَا فِيهَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُلِّ زَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">جٍ ك</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا خَلْقُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ فَأَرُونِى مَاذَا خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۚ بَلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمُونَ فِى ضَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"},{