pan>لِدَيْكَ إِلَىَّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٤</span>"},{"id":15,"tajweed":"وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ج</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَدَاكَ عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>ُشْرِكَ بِى مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> عِلْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مٌ ف</span>َلَا تُطِعْهُمَا‌ۖ وَصَاحِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>هُمَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا مَعْرُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">فًا‌ۖ و</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّبِعْ سَبِيلَ مَنْ أَنَابَ إِلَىَّ‌ۚ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ إِلَىَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأُنَبِّئُك<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِمَا كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ تَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٥</span>"},{"id":16,"tajweed":"يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بُنَىَّ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َكُ مِثْقَالَ حَبَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>ِّنْ خَرْدَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">لٍ ف</span>َتَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ف</span>ِى صَخْرَةٍ أَوْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ أَوْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ يَأْتِ بِهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ‌ۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ لَطِيفٌ خَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٦</span>"},{"id":17,"tajweed":"يَ<span class=\"tj